{"author":{"id":"836d943203cf5a4f01ab5d4b4780de84949c43734f2256a167cc5931ae5d8c66"},"ops":[{"type":6,"timestamp":1794172943,"nonce":"kICQr54rJ3+49sajc3CL4FQlrec=","target":"211b05aa7fe8e95c8715789aec70693cb4ab9ea8b58bc97611b86e127e43355c","message":"## Context\nRows and epic cards show summaries only; there is no way to read a body or comments.\n\n## Files\n- `src/ui/detail.rs` — new pane\n- `src/main.rs:67` — select/close detail messages, lazy load\n\n## Approach\n- `cargo add iced --features markdown` (keeps existing features).\n- Selecting a row or card opens the pane at once with the summary already in memory plus a skeleton body, then loads `gitbug::show` (L1) async; pane shows title, full + human id, kind/state/status, labels, author, created/edited, body rendered with iced `markdown`, comments, parent epic link or children list.\n- Parse markdown once when the detail arrives, keep the parsed items; never reparse in `view`.\n- In-memory detail cache keyed by (repo, id, edit_time): reopening an unchanged issue is instant; a newer `edit_time` refetches.\n- Copy buttons via `iced::clipboard::write`: full id, and `/roadmap:impl \u003cfull-id\u003e`.\n- Esc or close button dismisses.\n\n## Depends on\nL5 — epic children wiring\n\n## Out of scope\n- Editing anything (L7).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Unit test: selecting an issue shows the pane in a loading state and emits a load task; a loaded detail is stored against the right repo + id; reselecting an unchanged issue emits no task\n- Manual: markdown headings and code blocks render; copy puts the exact `/roadmap:impl \u003cid\u003e` string on the clipboard\n- All three gates pass","files":null}]}